usage() {
    cat <<USAGE
l2 $APP_VERSION - tiny Linux for tools (gum TUI + reproducible builder)

usage:
  l2                          interactive menu
  l2 deps [install|check]     distro dependency installer / checker
  l2 build [all|COMP...]      components: musl headers kernel busybox dash
                              rcl2 l2pm l2wifi libnl wpa openssl
                              firmware wifipack hwpack limine l2gpt e2fsprogs
                              dosfstools installpack rootfs initramfs iso
  l2 build desktop              build optional Xorg, xinit, xterm, l2wm, drivers, fonts and ISO
  l2 build l2wm|xorg|xinit|xterm|desktop-input|desktop-fonts
  l2 iso desktop                repackage compiled desktop components into l2-desktop.iso
  l2 kernel [menu|set CONFIG_X=v ...|show|reset]
                              kernel settings (config/kernel.local)
  l2 iso [out.iso]            core ISO (<${L2_ISO_LIMIT_MB} MiB) and, if a wifi pack exists, l2-wifi.iso
  l2 ram [--sizes 256M,1G,16G] [--budget KiB]   idle-RAM sweep under QEMU
  l2 bootiso [file.iso] [--uefi]                boot the ISO under QEMU and check the shell
  l2 update                   lock latest kernel/musl/dash/limine
  l2 pm ARGS...               run l2pm
  l2 fetch                    run l2fetch
  l2 shared                   install l2pm/l2fetch/l2install/l2wifi tools here
  l2 install ARGS...          run l2install (disk|image|iso|shared|dir|menu)
  l2 doctor                   tools, artifacts, kernel sanity, l2pm RAM
